# Phase discipline

Read [docs/master-spec.md](docs/master-spec.md) and the current phase doc before changing code.

Work only on the current phase. The current phase is Phase 9.

Do feature work on `develop`. Merge to `main` only when the user is ready for production.

Phase 9 may add Stripe Connect in **test mode**, embedded seller onboarding, Checkout, separate charges and transfers at settlement, and idempotent webhooks. Do not add live Stripe keys, seller bank payouts, refund/chargeback workflows, or authority integrations. Never trust the browser for payment status, bid time, or quota availability. Never delete quota ledger rows.

Do not create later-phase tables or speculative architecture.

Keep dependencies minimal. Prefer the simplest solution that satisfies the current phase.

Stop at the end of each phase. After acceptance criteria pass, report results and wait for instruction.
